    this.Text("AmmoExpanded-Cal308Win-Desc", "A classic .308 Winchester rifle cartridge — one of the most widely manufactured centerfire rounds in North America for over half a century, prized by Militech contractors and wasteland scavengers alike for its balance of range, penetration, and universal availability.");
    this.Text("AmmoExpanded-Cal308Win-AP-Desc", ".308 Winchester copper-jacketed lead projectile encapsulating a dense, hardened-tungsten rod core. Improved performance against armor.");
    this.Text("AmmoExpanded-Cal308Win-HP-Desc", ".308 Winchester copper-jacketed lead projectile with an open cavity at the tip. Upon impacting a soft target, the projectile mushrooms outward, leading to increased tissue destruction and heavy bleeding.");
